          "description": "Two equal-height rectangles stacked vertically and left-aligned. The upper rectangle is shorter and divided into two equal regions; the lower rectangle is approximately eight-thirds as wide and divided into four equal regions. Each leftmost region has restrained green shading and its source fraction label.",
          "mathematics": "The upper shaded region represents one half of its whole; the lower shaded region represents one quarter of a larger whole. The lower shaded area is visibly larger.",
